    "type": "significant",
    "description": {
      "en": "The Sleepless first explained the nature of Dawnshards to Rysn, including the danger they present to the cosmere and the care with which they must be protected. She was specifically warned against bonding a spren and becoming a Knight Radiant, perhaps in part to prevent something like what happened to Aux.",
      "es": "Los Insomnes explicaron por primera vez a Rysn la naturaleza de las Esquirlas del Amanecer, incluido el peligro que suponen para el Cosmere y el cuidado con el que deben protegerse. Se le advirtió de forma expresa que no se vinculara con un spren ni se convirtiera en Caballero Radiante, quizá en parte para evitar algo como lo ocurrido a Aux."
    },
